            "data": "base64-decoded:<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<h1>Klebsiella pneumoniae Genomic Analysis Report</h1>\n<p><strong>Patient:</strong> KP Patient KP</p>\n<p><strong>Sample ID:</strong> KP</p>\n<p><strong>Report Date:</strong> <TIMESTAMP></p>\n<p><strong>Resistance Classification:</strong> Extended-Spectrum Beta-Lactamase (ESBL)</p><p><strong>MLST Sequence Type:</strong> ST15</p><p><strong>Capsule Type:</strong> K24</p><p><strong>Conclusion:</strong> ESBL-producing K. pneumoniae. ESBL genes: CTX-M-15. Predicted resistance to: Cefepime, Cefotaxime, Ceftazidime, Piperacillin-Tazobactam. MLST ST15. Capsule type: K24.</p><hr/><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n                <strong>Core Genome MLST Analysis</strong><br/>\n                Called Loci: 8/8 (100.0%)<br/>\n                Detailed allele profile included in components.\n                </div><h2>Detected Resistance Genes</h2><ul><li>CTX-M-15</li><li>SHV-28</li></ul><h2>MLST Allele Profile</h2><ul><li>gapA: 1</li><li>infB: 1</li><li>mdh: 1</li><li>pgi: 1</li><li>phoE: 1</li><li>rpoB: 1</li><li>tonB: 1</li></ul></div>",
